Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Biexciton: verify the first proposed move", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b0220274-6074-794e-a521-e08cc18075b1"],

Cell["\<\
The lowest 1,000,000-point candidate is re-evaluated at 2,000,000 MaxPoints. \
The returned association reports both energy differences, their disagreement, \
the acceptance threshold, and whether the center moves.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a24cfe3e-a636-8b40-a9b2-ea68f9f7af67"],

